    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d354">

                <pb facs="0396" n="362" sameAs="frus:frus1897/pg362"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Draper to Mr.
                            Sherman.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Rome</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1897-07-14T17:15:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 14,
                                1897—5.15 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your dispatch of the 22d (ultimo) relating to meat has been received. It may help
                    me to know, by telegraph, which European countries do not require consular visé
                    with shipments of meat.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Draper.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
